            "reviewer_id": "User_p1_0",
            "review_title": "Review at King's Grill",
            "review_text": "Jenny R\nWashington, USA55 contributions\n0\nAn Excellent Meal and Experience!\nMay 2025 • Business\nTraveling with a group of business professors and students, I booked a table at King's Grill for a dinner close to our hotel. The staff was so kind and helpful both in the booking process and the entire time we were at the restaurant. I ordered (using Google Translate and lots of laughter) for the table of 8 people, and the staff helped me pick a wonderful variety of dishes and just enough for the group. The service and presentation of the dishes was beyond our expectations, and everything was delicious! Several of us went back the next night with other students who had missed this special dinner!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 12, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-03",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
